# Riddonkulous Web - Global Documentation

## Styling and CSS

- Always cacheLife
  Route segment config "dynamic" is not compatible with `nextConfig.cacheComponents`. Please remove it.
- Uses Nextjs 16+
- Never use font-semibold, bold or other related boldness the projects Fonts do not support this
- Use the global.css file at all times for styling related questions (we exlusively use tailwind custom theming)
- Prefer Arrow functions
- Never use </strong>
- Avoid using default css tailwind classes for styling, use the styleguide we have and existsin `components` in the folder directory

